 Get to know us at genpact.com and on LinkedIn, YouTube, X, and Facebook.

**Job Description**


Monitor and manage IT infrastructure to ensure uptime and performance;  

* Troubleshoot hardware and software issues to identify root causes and implement solutions;
* Perform regular system maintenance tasks, such as updates, backups, and patches;
* Collaborate with cross\-functional teams to implement new technologies and improve existing systems;
* Create and maintain documentation for IT processes, procedures, and configurations;
* Implement and maintain security measures to protect systems and data from cyber threats;
* Provide technical support and assistance to end users on IT\-related issues.
